{"id":"5520","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5520_main_cirrus-spisatus-cumulonimbogenitus-cumulus-congestus-and-haze_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图片上方的云是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨云性密卷云</span>。它是3小时前在中国香港以南及西南方向100公里发展的一系列雷暴的余云。在这浓密的卷云块之下是另一个典型的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨云性密卷云</span>。在更靠近香港的第二行形成了这一稠密云块的母积雨云。在第二行云的东侧还可看到正在发展的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">浓积云</span>。这些云处于落日的阴影中（照片拍摄于日落前36分钟）。更靠近香港的是第三行云，其构成是东侧的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">中展积云</span>和中间不断增大的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">浓积云</span>。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">霾</span>已被输送并滞留在近海。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Tak Leung Ng","location":"中国，香港，赤鱲角","latitude":"纬度: 22° 18' 30'' N","longitude":"经度: 113° 55' 5'' E","date":"06 August 2013 1824 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西南","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 3","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.5"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5520_syn_cirrus-spisatus-cumulonimbogenitus-cumulus-congestus-and-haze_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>与热带风暴 “山竹”有关的深厚南东南到西南风导致中国香港近海出现了不稳定的天气。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 澳大利亚联邦2013，澳大利亚气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/upper/5520_upper_cirrus-spisatus-cumulonimbogenitus-cumulus-congestus-and-haze_clouds.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"></div>","copyright":"© 香港特别行政区政府","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/radar/5520_radar_cirrus-spisatus-cumulonimbogenitus-cumulus-congestus-and-haze_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"></div>","copyright":"© 香港特别行政区政府","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5520_sat_cirrus-spisatus-cumulonimbogenitus-cumulus-congestus-and-haze_clouds.png","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"></div>","copyright":"© 日本气象厅","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5505_main_cirrus-spissatus-cumulonimbogentitus-and-cumulus-mediocris_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>仍为砧状，该<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨云性密卷云</span>是大约45分钟前一个小而孤立的砧状鬃积雨云的余云。</p>\n<p>积云，主要为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">中展</span>云种，可完成云观测。</p>\n<p>这是放大的图像。详见附图。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Jarmo Koistinen","location":"芬兰，赫尔辛基","latitude":"纬度: 60° 0' 0'' N","longitude":"经度: 25° 0' 0'' E","date":"08 July 2011 1450 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 2, CM= 0, CH= 3","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.5"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5506_main_cirrus-spissatus-cumulonimbigenitus-and-cumulonimbus-capillatus-incus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc7\"><p>仍为砧形，该<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨云性密卷云</span>是大约45分钟前一个小而孤立的砧状鬃积雨云的余云。在发展的衰退阶段，新的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">砧状鬃积雨云</span>在左侧地平线约60公里外。在该单体的侧面是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">浓积云</span>单体或<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨云</span>单体；由于单体距离远且相对较小，无法根据本图做出准确识别。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">中展</span>云种为主的积云可完成云观测。右侧缩放的单体图像参见附图。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Jarmo Koistinen","location":"芬兰，赫尔辛基","latitude":"纬度: 60° 0' 0'' N","longitude":"经度: 25° 0' 0'' E","date":"08 July 2011 1449 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 0, CH= 3","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.5","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.5"}]}]}